# Practice and client projects live here but are never published.
#
# pica ships the METHOD - rules, commands, hooks, scripts. The projects it was
# derived from are evidence for the author, not content for anyone installing it,
# and they carry briefs, PRDs, real copy and client identifiers that must not be
# redistributed. The findings those projects produced are in CHANGELOG.md, which is
# the durable form: a rule and the failure that earned it, with no client data.
#
# The plugin surface itself is NEVER ignored - .claude-plugin/, commands/, skills/
# (rules and scripts), hooks/, README.md, CHANGELOG.md, LICENSE all ship.
spike/
docs/superpowers/

# Per-project pica state and captured artefacts, wherever a project is worked on.
.pica/
.audit/
.cmp/
